  "description": "Doxify document engine (Rust core) for .NET. This package is the server-side PDF API: open, render, extract text, add/edit/delete annotations, fill and flatten forms, page operations, full and incremental save. Word (DOCX) and Excel (XLSX) viewing and editing come in the Doxify.Blazor editor UI. The native engine is currently included for Windows x64 only.",
